LWC_HASH_KAT_128_256.txt, LWC_XOF_KAT_128_512.txt, LWC_CXOF_KAT_128_512.txt
    The known-answer tests of the reference implementation of the Ascon designers, updated for SP 800-232:
    crypto_hash/asconhash256, crypto_hash/asconxof128 and crypto_cxof/asconcxof128 of
    https://github.com/ascon/ascon-c (commit fdfca4089abb4a2a9afa45699e49b6a770e2c3c6), downloaded on 2026-10-24.
    License: CC0 1.0 Universal.
    Format: Count, Msg, Z (the customization string of Ascon-CXOF128) and MD (512 bits of output for the XOFs).
    Used: every record.

acvp.txt
    Extracted by a script from the sample vectors of the NIST ACVP server (gen-val/json-files/Ascon-Hash256-SP800-232,
    Ascon-XOF128-SP800-232 and Ascon-CXOF128-SP800-232 of https://github.com/usnistgov/ACVP-Server, the files
    internalProjection.json), downloaded on 2026-10-24: the tests whose lengths are whole bytes (umilib takes bytes,
    the ACVP files also test bit lengths).
    License: NIST software and data, a work of the United States government (public domain in the United States).
    Format: Key = Value records with the mode, the test number, msg, cs (the customization string) and md.
    Used: every record.
